  "design_conclusion": "RETAIN_EXISTING_DIRECT_REVEAL",
  "rationale": [
    "Observation spends one action slot and converts it into a consumable observation point, so its result must remain immediate and legible.",
    "Replacing direct reveal with inferred tactical clues would add content, UI, AI, localization, and validation cost without enough expected improvement to the core loop.",
    "The remaining answer-leak risk is accepted for human measurement rather than hidden behind an automatic nerf."
  ],
